Comment: 0,0:01:59.64,0:02:01.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{TS 01.58}Tasu News
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.45,0:00:27.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It looks like snow!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.67,0:00:30.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.58,0:00:45.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This is the end for the cherry blossoms this year then.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.02,0:00:51.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We don't have school tomorrow, so let's watch flowers together!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.39,0:00:57.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That sounds like fun! Should I make lunchboxes?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.15,0:01:00.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll cook too!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.99,0:01:01.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Come on now...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.24,0:01:01.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's great!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.56,0:01:02.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hurray!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.22,0:01:03.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Listen to me...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.13,0:01:09.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry for agreeing without asking you...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.92,0:01:13.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, no... It's perfectly fine with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.60,0:01:15.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll try to make something too.{lit bring something}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.37,0:01:17.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.68,0:01:27.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki's always causing you so much trouble...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.74,0:01:30.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well... You don't need to worry about that.{fuck politeness formulas}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.86,0:01:33.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki! Rin!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.93,0:01:38.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's meet tomorrow morning at eight in the park, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.39,0:01:39.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okie!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.80,0:01:41.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's too early...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.19,0:01:42.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Then nine!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.56,0:01:44.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,People don't watch flowers that early in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.22,0:01:47.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Then how about ten...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.76,0:01:50.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh wait, I gotta watch Gransazer!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.45,0:01:53.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Then let's make it noon, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.54,0:02:01.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.09,0:02:05.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, where are the bottles?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.09,0:02:07.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Aren't they under the sink?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.59,0:02:08.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.89,0:02:13.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It might rain tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.05,0:02:17.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There's a spring storm coming in.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.44,0:02:19.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Storm...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.54,0:02:25.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's already raining!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.27,0:02:30.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh man! And quite hard too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.52,0:02:35.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's make good-weather charms!{teruteru-bouzu}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.77,0:02:59.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.58,0:03:04.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The rain stopped!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.05,0:03:07.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.09,0:03:10.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Our charms saved the day!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.18,0:03:19.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Seems the wind might've stripped the trees...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.84,0:03:29.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It smells like green!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.28,0:03:41.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All the flowers are gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.34,0:03:44.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey there!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.03,0:03:45.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.62,0:04:01.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.86,0:04:32.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The sky is blooming!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.54,0:04:40.55,Sign,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur0.5\fad(445,395)\pos(338,182)}The Sky is Blooming
